      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280907",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Harrison",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728090204"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728090204": {
            "id": "728090204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler, thank you so much for your help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090205"
            ]
          },
          "728090205": {
            "id": "728090205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "If not for you, this place would have been my grave today...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090207",
              "728090209"
            ]
          },
          "728090207": {
            "id": "728090207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Um, you could say so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090210"
            ]
          },
          "728090210": {
            "id": "728090210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "I mean, you know that doing business is hard here on Ritou. This camp is... well, you can consider it a little trick of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090211"
            ]
          },
          "728090211": {
            "id": "728090211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Some days back, I commissioned a... friend to ship me some alcohol-making ingredients from Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090212"
            ]
          },
          "728090212": {
            "id": "728090212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "He then got a test batch of new product from the Dawn Winery, which was just shipped here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090213"
            ]
          },
          "728090213": {
            "id": "728090213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "But he hasn't been all that careful, so some of the boxes are broken, and the cap on a bottle of alcohol-making ingredients was loosened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090214"
            ]
          },
          "728090214": {
            "id": "728090214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "I decided to unscrew it so that I could then reinstall it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090215"
            ]
          },
          "728090215": {
            "id": "728090215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "But I never expected that a whole bunch of slimes would come jumping out of the unscrewed cap. What a strange occurrence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090216"
            ]
          },
          "728090216": {
            "id": "728090216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Brewing ingredients from the Dawn Winery, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090217"
            ]
          },
          "728090217": {
            "id": "728090217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Ah, it doesn't matter right now. As for the ingredients, I'll settle with that fellow the next time he comes by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090218"
            ]
          },
          "728090218": {
            "id": "728090218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "You've saved my life, and I owe you something for it. Take these first, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090219"
            ]
          },
          "728090219": {
            "id": "728090219",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "That aside, you see that small boat over there? That's another one of my little tricks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090220"
            ]
          },
          "728090220": {
            "id": "728090220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Using that boat, you can sneak over to Narukami Island from here. Convenient, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090221"
            ]
          },
          "728090221": {
            "id": "728090221",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And why would I need to \"sneak\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090222"
            ]
          },
          "728090222": {
            "id": "728090222",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Ah, you see, this is what they call \"expecting the unexpected.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090223"
            ]
          },
          "728090223": {
            "id": "728090223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Well, I need to go back and take stock of those goods, so I can't stay here long. Once again, thank you so much, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728090224"
            ]
          },
          "728090224": {
            "id": "728090224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "Looks like I'll have to change up my pick-up spot."
          },
          "728090209": {
            "id": "728090209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Harrison",
            "text": "I'm, ah, moving goods! Moving goods..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}